Find, install and update AppImages published on GitHub releases

Sawmill is an app store for AppImages. It lists apps from a reviewed catalog, finds the latest release of each app in its own repository, and installs it with a launcher in your app grid.

- Search apps by name, purpose, category or developer
- Installs the right AppImage for your computer and checks its checksum
- Adds each app to your app grid with its own icon
- Uninstalls cleanly, removing the app and its launcher
- Installs itself on first run, so it updates like any other app
